00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,723
As Uke comes to grab both wrist from behind

2
00:00:03,124 --> 00:00:04,220
draw him towards you

3
00:00:04,621 --> 00:00:06,830
as he travels behind you for the other wrist,

4
